  "title": "Unum Group Reports First Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "Net income of $232.0 million ($1.41 per diluted common share) for the first quarter of 2026; after-tax adjusted operating income was $352.5 million ($2.14 per diluted common share). Favorable core operations top-line trends continued, with 14.4 percent sales growth and 3.9 percent premium growth on a constant currency basis; strong core operations margins, including 21.7 percent adjusted operating return on equity, drove solid traditional U.S. life insurance company statutory operating earnings",
